      <content:encoded><![CDATA[
        <h2>Estate Planning Overview</h2>
        <p>Estate planning encompasses the process of preparing for the inevitable transfer of your wealth to your heirs and the management of your financial affairs during your lifetime and after your death.</p>
        <h3>Key Components</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Wills and Testamentary Trusts</strong> - Essential documents for directing asset distribution</li>
          <li><strong>Power of Attorney</strong> - Grants authority to manage financial affairs during incapacity</li>
          <li><strong>Healthcare Directives</strong> - Specifies medical care preferences</li>
          <li><strong>Beneficiary Designations</strong> - On insurance policies, RRSPs, and TFSAs</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></content:encoded>
